  "counterpoint": {
    "text": "Epoch's current trend, frontier language models since 2020, is roughly 5x per year, a 5.2-month doubling. More compute does not automatically mean smarter AI; it is an ingredient, not the finished product. And GPT-5 in August 2025 broke from the trend, training with less compute than GPT-4.5 while shifting most of the new spend into post-training RL.",
    "source": "Epoch AI trends dashboard, Feb 2026"
  }
